00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:22.440
And, finally!

00:05:22.440 --> 00:05:26.750
Hold on to your papers, because if you look
here, you see that the dam break scene can

00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:32.710
be simulated with about 5 frames per second,
not seconds per frame, while the water drop

00:05:32.710 --> 00:05:38.500
